  "finding": "E4 did not repeat: 0/10 both arms, against 2/5 in the full-suite run. Mechanism measured, not inferred: all 32 scratch-access attempts in the candidate arm used bash (grep/ls/open), which cannot resolve the scratch:// scheme \u2014 only read_file can. The model recalled the needle 8/10 times by RE-DERIVING it (sha256 of the seed), which E4 taint-disqualifies by design. The virtual ref removed bash from the recovery routes, and bash is what the model reaches for. This is the same reduced-affordance hypothesis that carbon accept ch-06 raised and could not discriminate."
